// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P658899080" "I think we might have something here."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3908956251" "Sweet!  This looks like a good place."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1117772546" "Huh...I see prospects here."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P172128908" "Oh man...you should see this place.  Major score.  Major."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3510589150" "Write this location down.  Some pretty sweet stuff in there."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3109960257" "I knew Kings Row would be a big score.  I see some sweet stuff in here."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4045626994" "Got it.  Now let's go before someone gets wise."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P467533595" "Move it along, pal.  People are looking."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
