// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CASEBUILDING_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P515942184" "Plan B!  Plan B!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4101316857" "This is AWESOME!  Get it again!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2858219387" "Sweet!  Is that smoke!?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P76597711" "This rocks!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3346090583" "This is MUCH more fun than harassing old ladies!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3400090875" "Oh man...this is FUN!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1617280634" "You smell something?  Bah, who cares!  Hit it again!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1704266016" "Find your own vehicle to trash!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P721747319" "This one's ours!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P239022818" "Beat it!  We got this one!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4139914654" "You are NOT getting in on this action!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2210736669" "Up for some breakins later?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3718382046" "Let's harass people later.  I just want to rest for a while.  We've been at it for the last few hours.  I'm beat."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1450832433" "Who knew being a thug took so much energy?  Can we just rest a bit?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P623180724" "Some days, I just don't feel like stealing purses.  Those ladies never carry anything I can use."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1318578786" "I'm kinda hungry."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1992891135" "Hey, I got a date soon so, I can't sit here all day."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2237711033" "Time to get back to work!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P952330753" "You there!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P663796776" "Hey!  I see some fun approaching."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3267570126" "Alright then!  Let's do this!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1248496599" "Check it out!  Party came to us."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P83552586" "I don't know why I like Kings Row better.  It's just grittier.  You know?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P701248799" "Let's go break into some cars in the Police Department parking lot later."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2914375945" "Let's go destroy a car or something later."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4293978318" "Seriously.  He GOT the purse.  Ask him yourself."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3788189460" "Yeah, I know.  They talk all day.  Just ignore them."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1385174661" "I saw some cops patrolling our turf.  What's up with that?"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1805314547" "Come get some!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P648394013" "Oh you think so, huh?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1816484321" "Oh we gonna have some fun now!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4109027516" "You're no match for us, hero!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P257759388" "So, like, yeah...do I look fat in this?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2270242664" "I dunno.  King's Row is totally okay and all, but I kind of liked Atlas Park.  It was shiny.  So which one of these guys is yours?  There's mine.  Isn't he cute?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2786681573" "Oh, no.  I put my foot down.  I said, 'Look I don't mind you busting into places, just don't bust into our own apartment building'.  He said ok."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3561251076" "Don't we look so good with these guys?  I mean, seriously!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1862135823" "So maybe you wanna go get some sodas later?  I'm pretty sure my guy has some cars to blow up later."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P682795856" "This was not part of the arrangement!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P362031384" "I'm so out of here!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2284783894" "You never said anything about danger!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2010959424" "This is ridiculous!  My hair is messed up now!  I'm gone!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3062010592" "You're so high maintenance!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P822743455" "It's just not working out!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_PRYGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1196608654" "It's...not...coming...loose."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_PRYGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3923720465" "This is ridiculous.  I work out for cryin' out loud."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_PRYGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1327755428" "I'm sure I...loosened it."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P172510048" "Man, you have no upper body strength.  My grandmother could crack that open in no time."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2473170420" "Whatever workout you're doing, you need to up the weight, man.  It ain't workin' for ya."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P340200660" "Okay if you don't move it a little faster, we're gonna call attention to ourselves.  I mean, more than we already have."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3483391640" "Can't we just blow it up?  This is taking an awfully long time."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P165450204" "I tooooold you!  Leave it.  We got bigger problems."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P53939154" "Leave it, we're busted!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PRYBAR_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3585498612" "I'm sure whatever we pilfer outta this hero will be better than anything down in that sewer anyway."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3517407803" "Seriously, lady!  I'm gonna get it this time!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2656408565" "Today is NOT your lucky day!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2906428644" "Nothing's gonna stop me now!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3865136621" "I want what you got in that purse!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P373168035" "I got it!  I got it!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2304343181" "I told you!  I got it!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4110990497" "Yes!  It's MINE!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_MUGGER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P767921654" "Mwa ha ha ha haaa!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3928333914" "You are a blight on society!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1420239895" "I hope you cut yourself on the clasp!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P620689565" "You're kidding me right!?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3975055171" "It's like every street corner, you thugs show up!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3649336629" "I'm going to go find a cop!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2135866165" "I'm heading to the Police Department to report this right now!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PURSERUN_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2422191415" "I'll be front and center for your police lineup!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3336038330" "You really can't rush great art."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2828313300" "I'm inspired."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P407690218" "I'm in awe of my own amazing talent."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2715046313" "This...now this...should be in a museum."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1437561032" "Beautiful.  Stunning.  Breathtaking."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1213294148" "There are no words for how amazing I am.  Except super amazing."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P187595477" "Never interrupt an artist at work!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1174249445" "The nerve!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1728516459" "You broke my creativity streak!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P241060244" "Yes...yes...you're brilliant.  Can we GO now?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3969179134" "3,423 pebbles, 3,424 pebbles, 3,425..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1620624230" "I'm sleeping with my eyes open."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P862548246" "This is boring.  Can we go now?  I thought tagging stuff was a quick thing?  Stealthy."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4248086761" "And now the fun begins."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1078901570" "We got company, Michelangelo."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3170307188" "Rembrandt.  Quit it.  The jig is up."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2861415344" "Spray painting must wait.  Commence beatdown."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CHECKINGSTOLENPURSE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2805005712" "What have we got here?  Huh?  What was that?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CHECKINGSTOLENPURSE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4198136868" "Bag is mine.  The bag is mine.  Ha ha ha!  Huh?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CHECKINGSTOLENPURSE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1488445913" "I got it...yes!  It's mine!  Mine mine--  what was that?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_CHECKINGSTOLENPURSE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2219342802" "My bag.  My bag.  My bag.  Finally.  My bag.  Yes!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1029429837" "See, the trick is to not breathe when you pull the trigger."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P769300826" "We should target practice for money.  Would make it a little more interesting."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P928569748" "Oh yes...now THAT is how it's done, man."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P582650403" "Dang, I'm a good shot!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P238515222" "I am firing a gun and you're interrupting me?  That's a death sentence, pal."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2657739006" "Oh look...MOVING targets!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P182848008" "This target practice just got more fun!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3947888845" "Yes, you're amazing.  Spectacular.  When is it my turn?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1285783086" "I think you missed there."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1322325523" "Uh...yeah, you missed by a mile there."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2274480485" "Nice shot."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1199481431" "So, this is fun and all, but when is it my turn?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4178248556" "Nice one."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3252077853" "Practice time is over.  Now's for reals."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3917268435" "Uh...I hate to interrupt but...point that gun thisaway!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3213055179" "Now's a great time to be a GOOD shot!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P529730422" "Kings Row is ours!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3727594411" "You'll never win you know!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P60563238" "Get outta Kings Row!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3218377599" "Dude, watch up for the blow up guy!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P110280498" "More!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P745433562" "We got some heroes!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4266487125" "Hey, whatever!  More to the party!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_SKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1417747923" "Heroes!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3736850700" "You...die..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2508742861" "I'll pick your bones clean...I promise..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4081709556" "Such lofty promises...from a would-be corpse."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_VAHZILOK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3923538724" "More is better."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_VAHZILOK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2504210175" "Join the fray.  You'll do."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_VAHZILOK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3286598243" "Don't be scared.  It spoils the meat."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLETRUCK_ATTACKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3246914959" "Whoa!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P52149329" "That's for the black eye last week!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4128699129" "You got some nerve hitting on my girlfriend, punk!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2286302794" "And THAT'S for tripping me into Grendel's Gulch!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2752418739" "And THAT'S for the sucker punch to the gut last week!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2371549107" "You want some of this, too?  Bring it!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3470406980" "Bring it!  I got plenty to spare!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3799738130" "I'll take all of you on!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3134839495" "How's the bat feel?  Hard?  Good!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3555711925" "Is your head taking too much damage from my bat?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1203862864" "Oh, I'm sorry.  Did I get your head?  That's gonna cause a lump!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1246470158" "You...never...listen...when...I...speak!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4294353909" "This bat's for you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P441307535" "You want some of this?  Let's play major league hitter!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3593935767" "I'm gonna cut you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2393451797" "Feel my blade!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4175340806" "Ha!  I nicked your shirt!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2800148334" "You shouldn't have messed with us!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P828221686" "You know you're no match for us!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4049075181" "WHAT!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2701874435" "Don't...bug...me...again."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2105935460" "This...is...for...that...situation...last week!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1072130988" "You...can't...beat...us!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2830028410" "You're next!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3229673563" "I can do this all day!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2908761795" "You make a great punching bag!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2735045043" "My fist is getting tired connecting with your face!  You ready to yell 'uncle' yet?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2665139933" "I'll take you on, too, punk!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1654025528" "Oh yeah?  You want some, too?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2713749795" "You got no place here, hero!"


// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P710729978" "You smell!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2813207350" "You're dead!  I mean that literally in a futuristic sense!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2642670248" "I'm gonna gut you like a fish!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2549482081" "You don't wanna bug me with a knife in my hand!  Too late!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2171711677" "You're gone!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2545793946" "I'll cut you up, too!"


// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2575049519" "Give me a reason to mess you up! <em>Wait, I don't need one!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2247068554" "Come here!  I'll beat you into next week!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BARBRAWL_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3992790422" "Oh I don't think so!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P273199237" "Just...one...more...minute..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1791776533" "I...think...I...almost...got...it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P852138058" "Shut...up...I'm...working."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2532450759" "Not a whole lot of finesse involved with a tire iron is there?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2136017626" "Whatever happened to listening to the 'click'?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2651106021" "Hey...why don't we just break a window?  It'd be faster."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2167504525" "Company!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1362099995" "We didn't do nuthin'!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1003182480" "You didn't see anything!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1820220304" "Baby, it's just not working out.  You run every time things get rough."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2900085756" "Look, it's gotta end.  You're holding me back."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1264342708" "Well, it's not you, it's me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P813033579" "I'm just not in that space for a relationship right now."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2650563020" "The time we spent together, however long it was, meant the world to me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4050080124" "We're just star-crossed loves and the fact that your sister stole my car makes it pretty hard for me to keep seeing you."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1138769548" "Well, this whole girlfriend-boyfriend thing is just too much work, really."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2748455484" "We're done, baby, that's all there is to it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4261957925" "Well, you never want to do anything really.  All you want to do is brag to your girlfriends.  But you never really DO anything."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3565191590" "We just don't talk like we used to."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P340458095" "Saved by the hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4284244850" "Sorry, hon, it was fun while it lasted!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2340769073" "Off you go!  Papa's got work to do!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4085637444" "Off you go, daddy's got work to do!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3034314488" "Sorry, baby!  For reals!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P323396738" "Well, I just can't get behind what you do.  I mean, being a Skulls girlfriend is a thankless job.  I always have to run when things get good.  I hate that."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2253442904" "You never involve me in your life.  I'm constantly running into buildings when the heat is on.  What kind of relationship is that?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3524057044" "Well it's just not working for me.  We never talk.  You never take me to movies."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2068089104" "Well, I'm afraid that this whole Skulls thing isn't for me anymore.  I'm dating one of those Legacy Chain guys now.  <em>They're mystical."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P891554487" "Oh, don't be hurt.  You're awesome.  You're just not my kind of awesome."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3463753806" "Well, you're super bad and all that, but I need something more.  Something solid. <em>Like an accountant."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2418430708" "It's just too hard to date you.  You're more high maintenance than me and I can't deal with that."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2708877193" "You know how you always say you're always right and I'm the princess?  Well, I'm the princess AND I'm right.  So what do I need you for?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1463108048" "Don't call me!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1981125354" "It's been real, hon!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BREAKUP_HEARTCRUSHER_NPC_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1526189486" "Bye now!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3626706725" "What?  I don't know where I am!  I'm not moving!  This place is crawling in bad guys!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2820784554" "Hello?  HELLO?!  Can you hear me?  HELLO!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3884578400" "I'm stuck in the Hollows!  No I don't know where I am!  Are you coming or not!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3184960366" "Look!  Just send SOMEONE to come get me!  It's dangerous here and I'm a woman all by myself!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P945216587" "I could get hurt, okay?!  I can't be alone here!  This is THE HOLLOWS!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P435330703" "No!  No this isn't a phony phone call!  What is wrong with you!  I'm in the Hollows!  Come help me!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2338956321" "Where am I?  I don't know!  I can't see a street sign!  There's buildings and bad guys, what more do you want from me?! <em>SEND HELP!!!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3166606588" "Hello!!  Can you hear me???  HELLO???  I'm not playing!  I'm stuck in the HOLLOWS!<em>YES!  The Hollows!!  Hello??"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4160600218" "Hee hee!  Sucker!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2984015307" "Got another one, hon!  See you at home!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P433074939" "Here you go, baby!  Another one for you!  Let's do Thai tonight!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1838669923" "Hey, baby.  Another sucker for ya!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1674633437" "I can't believe you fell for that!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P511310137" "So lame!  Who falls for this stuff??"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_SKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P988645317" "Thanks, babe!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_SKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P725272667" "Baby, you're the best!  Now beat it.  Daddy's got work to do!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_SKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2467367223" "Nice job, hon!  I'll take over from here!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_PRONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3315150297" "Ungh...  Someone...help..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_PRONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2445383447" "Help...me..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_PRONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P648087613" "Please...someone..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_PRONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3028646554" "Ohh...I don't feel good..."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2369353012" "HELP!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3505865600" "HELP ME!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2899619102" "ANYONE!  OVER HERE!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1745605466" "HEEELLLP!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPCBAIT_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1235774608" "HELPPP!  I'm LOST!!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1159431231" "Yep.  We got the stuff."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4201561887" "Uh huh.  Uh huh.  Okay.  Uh huh.  Sure thing.  Okay.<em>Mom, I gotta go.  Get off this channel."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2089271981" "What?  How many crates?  Did someone forget to add a zero???"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1697560289" "Are you kidding me?  We're organized crime for pete's sake! Where's the organization in THAT?!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P952101503" "I'm gonna take my petty frustrations out on YOU, Hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P983181954" "Right on time as usual, Hero!  You are a pain in my side!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1058161996" "Man, you guys bug me!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P497590110" "She dumped me.  Can you believe that?  After two weeks.  Who does that?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P712075948" "I'm too good looking.  That's what it is.  She couldn't take it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1813040366" "I'm too awesome for her.  She couldn't take it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P618157289" "Well, I don't know...I just got a feeling, you know?  I think one of ours is doing deals behind our backs."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3717688158" "So...what's the word on the street?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3250482045" "You know, as much as I like having the girls around, some days, I wish they'd just be quiet."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1592050684" "No way.  She said that?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P497176035" "Well, of course you're awesome.  I keep telling you that.  You're much more awesome than he is."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2427128314" "Hey, did you notice the Trolls down in the Gulch?  I mean, who does that?  It's suicide!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2657759050" "I've seen that movie.  <em>Hated it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1038482796" "I've seen that movie. <em> LOVED it!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1809660722" "Nah, I'm not in the mood. <em>Hey, wanna throw a Troll at a policeman and watch the sparks fly?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P310997812" "You call intruding on a conversation heroic?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2223461719" "You're lame."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3397006762" "Heroes are lame!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P191027477" "And yet, I wouldn't walk in on YOUR conversation.<em>Cuz it's probably BORING!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3778484432" "Why can't you just leave us alone?!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2705903845" "Two minutes peace for a conversation!  Is it too much to ask?   Apparently it is!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P99407858" "I love winning!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P659165270" "I love winning so much, I'd marry it if I could!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4140016201" "I win win win!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1128014147" "I'm the best!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1121130431" "Win!  W!<em> I!<em>N!<em>What's that spell?  ME!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P128543882" "But I was winning!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4230708426" "Not fair!  I was winning!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3585874189" "Heyyyy... I was winning!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P586869315" "Booooo!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2096463544" "You ruined my winning streak!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2515829234" "Isn't he so cute?  I just love his t-shirt."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P994364595" "So these Skulls guys are so strong and powerful.  I can see why all the other gangs pale in comparison to them."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2057234709" "I...can't...believe...I'm...hanging...with...the Skulls."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3175657670" "This is SO COOL."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1842842442" "So does my eyeliner make me look, like, super pale?<em>Cool!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2329140637" "Oh yeah.  Can you believe it? She dumped in for a Legacy Chain guy. <em>I'm, like, whatever!  Did you see what those guys wear?<em>Whatevs."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P35900969" "I wonder when it gets real fun.  So far all they do is rip off purses and fight each other.<em>It gets better, right?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2990712519" "Oh yeah, so we're going to go see a movie later.  I know!  He's so sweet.  He's paying, too!  He just said he had to run to his bank machine. <em>He has his own bank machine!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2182952719" "Ack!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1827559994" "I'm out of here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2199959473" "You didn't say anything about guns!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1490471431" "Ohmigosh!  They're fighting!  Run!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1513008621" "Ohmigosh, I'm out of here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P719421254" "Hey!  You nearly hit my hair!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4099385805" "What the--!  That ALMOST HIT ME!  Run!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P368254074" "I hate this part!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P685289581" "I hate you."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P434078191" "I hate you and I hate that you're winning and I hate that I'm still standing here playing with you."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2397676702" "Dumb luck."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2804431839" "This is not fair."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3245010714" "Fine.  I don't care that you're wining.  Later we'll play cards and I will squash you. <em>ARGH!  Again?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2945816332" "SERIOUSLY?!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P403357869" "Oh, finally!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2843259021" "Thank goodness!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3138725721" "YES!  Finally!  An interruption!"


// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_CELLPHONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P399624504" "Ohmigosh, thank you so much!  No one else would believe me!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_CELLPHONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4182446915" "You are a true hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_CELLPHONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2034428374" "I don't know how I got here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_CELLPHONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1562483321" "I shouldn't have listened to that girl!  She said there was a party near here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_CELLPHONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3272306357" "Oh how can I thank you??"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_CELLPHONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P373038812" "You are so amazing!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_CELLPHONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1451161575" "You're a true hero!"


// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_PRONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2647018797" "Oh, thank you...I feel better now.  I'm never coming back here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_PRONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2806295023" "I don't know what happened.  Someone knocked me out!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_PRONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2663857789" "Thank you so much!  This place is awful!  I'm going back to Atlas Park!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_PRONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2338303163" "I don't know what happened, but I thank you for coming by!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_PRONE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3975235123" "No one would help me.  They just crossed on the other side of the street or ignored me!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1233230365" "You!  Help!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3904480370" "Someone!  Help me!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3556536016" "HEEEEEEEEELP!!!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1576903680" "I'm stranded!  Help me!  Someone!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P664129696" "Where's a hero when you need one? <em>HELP!  SOMEONE!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P321396021" "IS ANYONE OUT THERE WHO WILL HELP ME????"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P568524895" "Hi!  Oh thank you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1637109584" "I just needed a diversion!  There are so many villains, I didn't know how to get away!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2590149502" "Thank you for coming over!  I knew if I had a hero nearby I could make an escape to one of these buildings!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DECOY_NPC_REALSTRANDED_BIGWAVE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1668398273" "Thank you so much for coming by!  I think I'm going to be okay now!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2570252831" "Keep an eye out.  I don't trust those guys."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4084510036" "Hey, they have their space.  We have ours.  They step in our space, it's on."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2642804773" "Oh, it'll be on.  Count on it.  It'll be so on, it's nuclear on.  They step even a pinky toe in here and the 'on-ness' of it will hit them like a brick!<em>What?  I was motivating myself.  Standing here is boring."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1475817175" "Hey, I can see my girlfriend from here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4057505343" "What do you say?  We keep an eye out for trespassers for a while, then go out for a bite?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3457133054" "Man, my dogs are barkin'.  How long we gotta stand here?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1637055469" "What was that?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P315368272" "Hold on...someone's coming closer.  Yep.  Keep coming.  We'll fight old school."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3178375819" "Here we go!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P797501698" "I told you someone was coming!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2948624183" "Ready for some pain?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P392978224" "This is going to hurt you!  A lot!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1530674655" "I look better than you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1515422144" "You got nothing, punk!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3981001983" "That all you got?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2254964551" "Lemme show you how it's done!"

// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3686331101" "Whaaat??"
// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P292184420" "It meant nothin'."
// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1434036963" "Whatever. You forgive me tomorrow."
// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2059768080" "Why you always fly off handle?"
// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P55093314" "C'mon, baby. Let it go."

// KINGS_GF_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P17112894" "You say you stop screwing around. I want payback!"
// KINGS_GF_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1154791013" "This isn't over!"
// KINGS_GF_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1152248679" "Your excuse is like crap."
// KINGS_GF_DRAMA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P808882723" "You give me good reason why I should stay."

// KINGS_BEATDOWN_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4000988122" "Finish up, we need to leave."
// KINGS_BEATDOWN_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3552985487" "I think I hear sirens."
// KINGS_BEATDOWN_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3726025160" "We need to skate. Just break his neck already."
// KINGS_BEATDOWN_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2743831983" "I think he's getting the message."

// KINGSROW_SKULLS_BREADLINE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P115079698" "My clients! You'll pay for that, FREAK!"
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_BREADLINE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2258354676" "We got company!"
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_BREADLINE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P879917180" "Come here so I can skin you alive!"

// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3363473744" "You got this!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4042612593" "C'mon, Varis! You got this!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3597279832" "C'mon, Markus! You got this!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3376668389" "C'mon, Lukas! Stab this chump!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3317944843" "C'mon, Ivan! You got this!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2197932724" "C'mon, Dmitri! Stab this chump!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2168065138" "C'mon, Yakov! Stab this chump!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1992492238" "C'mon, Boris! Stab this chump!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3001664447" "You lose, I leave. That's all there is to it"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_GF_SPECTATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2468670082" "Ugh, COME ON! ...it helps to actually LAND a punch from time to time."

// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P631883640" "I LOVE our new way of ranking."
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3319790337" "Big bump to whoever wins!"
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1340418577" "Remember to move like water, not like idiot."

// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2015954975" "Bonus to anyone who takes down the hero."
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P107691688" "Time for exam! Show me what you've learned."
// KINGS_FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ALERTED_TEXT :
