// KINGSROW_JUNKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2773518233" "Huh... Wha?"
// KINGSROW_JUNKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1521073854" "Whoa, man... I am OUTTA here!"
// KINGSROW_JUNKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4015964774" "This is too much for me, man."

// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P94485312" "Heh... and another one bites the dust."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1180063958" "He's feelin' it."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3358035413" "One more client goes in my bag."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P180139590" "Amazing what free sample can do for buisness."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1348018662" "I got a feeling I'm gonna run this block."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2993456578" "We may need to stock up again soon."

// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P50691284" "My Client! You'll pay for that, cape."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P371514469" "We got company."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_JUNKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P923552846" "Come here so I can burn you alive!"

// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2337247414" "And what goodies did I get today..?"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2838372665" "What is all this junk? Guess I'll have to try again."
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1417064695" "What is this old lady junk?"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1751734951" "I don't need make-up, I need money!"

// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P720972896" "Punk!"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1004750513" "Get back!"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2466502163" "I'll shoot oyu dead!"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_SKULL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2412046845" "Your outfit is hurting my eyes!"

// KINGSROW_PURSE_VICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3264064035" "Wowee! Look at the get-up on this one."
// KINGSROW_PURSE_VICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2171300514" "Did your mom dress you this morning?"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_VICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1177088502" "Look at this one, now. What a weirdo!"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_VICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3474597281" "Is it halloween already?"
// KINGSROW_PURSE_VICTIM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4097872300" "Why you heroes dress so crazy?"

// KINGSROW_PURSE_SNATCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3301833175" "It's your life, lady. Gamble it if you want."
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SNATCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2973286481" "If you don't let go I'll take you with me."
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SNATCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026343522" "You don't let go? Fine. I can take you too."
// KINGSROW_PURSE_SNATCH_SKULL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4133400182" "This is a robbery, lady. Don't make it murder."

// KINGSROW_PURSE_SEARCH_GIRLFRIEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3538254489" "Beats dealing with the gargoyles at make-up counter."


// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1765509677" "Hey piggies, what's the big idea?"
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1599251177" "Sorry, officers. We didn't know we can't take purse."

// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_PPD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P560824147" "So, you freaks called on friend to come save you?"

// KINGS_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2990883459" "Damn PUNKS!"
// KINGS_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4290744705" "I'm warning you punks. We no longer have the patience to do this by the books."

// KINGSROW_SKULLS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P305561039" "I'm getting good at this stuff."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2773007877" "Next time someone paints over this, people die."

// KINGSROW_SKULLS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3732137465" "Why you heroes dress so crazy? It makes me want to punch puppy."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3640022870" "Why you heroes dress so crazy? It makes me want to drown kitten."

// KINGSROW_SKULLS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1829081981" "I think I have drinking problem."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2525449980" "I have a drinking problem. Problem is I can't get a drink around here."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1948558515" "We're having a bonfire party tonight in the gravel lot. You should come and keep me company."
// KINGSROW_SKULLS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P902881823" "There's Superadine party tonight in the old warehouse. Maybe we go and provide the bones."

// KINGSROW_SKULLS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3090734037" "Nice costume! Did you fall asleep at the sewing machine or something?"

// KINGS_LOOT_DEAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046382447" "This is primo goods, yes?"
// KINGS_LOOT_DEAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2149084459" "Come on, I cut you a deal."
// KINGS_LOOT_DEAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1827737911" "There's more where I got this from."

// KINGS_LOOT_DEAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P153462861" "Is the circus in town or something?"

// KINGS_LOOT_RECEIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3947924861" "What is this? What are you trying to pull?"
// KINGS_LOOT_RECEIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3974091170" "This is crap."
// KINGS_LOOT_RECEIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4067698328" "I don't need these things you bring."
// KINGS_LOOT_RECEIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P783396432" "Why must you bring me these things? They are crap."

// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3108991103" "Hey little lady, how's about a kiss?"
// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3679675094" "You want to make money?"
// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1600152403" "You give me money, yes?"
// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1108862049" "You're cute when you're scared."
// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4128448793" "You're very pretty, you know?"
// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2529815634" "You have a pretty skull."
// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4068912343" "We come to collect your husband's debts. Come quietly, or else."

// KINGS_SHAKEDOWN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3732556501" "Hey! You're blowing up my spot."

// KINGS_CARJACK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4197137286" "Almost... there."
// KINGS_CARJACK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P59595538" "That sweet sterio is as good as mine."
// KINGS_CARJACK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1790538129" "We make record time this time."
// KINGS_CARJACK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1516094516" "Man, I hope this car will make Luna forgive me."
// KINGS_CARJACK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4173867721" "I hope this car will make Goda forgive what I did."
// KINGS_CARJACK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1201388702" "I hope this car will make Sofia take me back."
// KINGS_CARJACK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3333892766" "I hope this car will make Milana forgive me."


// KINGS_LEDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4248692211" "I'm just waiting for a good time."
// KINGS_LEDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P648342322" "Up for some break-ins later?"
// KINGS_LEDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3972911932" "Yes, I too like to punch. Think I will be doing it later."
// KINGS_LEDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1038193231" "I just want to rest a while."
// KINGS_LEDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2443019354" "Whew, I'm beat from beating."
// KINGS_LEDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P222969577" "Some days I just don't feel like stealing purses. Those ladies never carry anything useful."
// KINGS_LEDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P349391199" "I'm feeling kinda hyper."


// KINGS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P79400517" "I LOVE this stuff!"
// KINGS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P463565824" "Stupid auto! Watch this."
// KINGS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3387768572" "These are good times!"
// KINGS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2425586809" "I do good at hitting cars. Watch!"

// KINGS_PPD_DEAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3873084640" "Help us waste the cape, copper, and we MIGHT let you live!"
// KINGS_PPD_DEAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P168280474" "Who called the capes?"
// KINGS_PPD_DEAL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2301756366" "What is this, Halloween?"

// KINGS_DEAL_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1554787296" "We don't care about your family. Our game, our rules."
// KINGS_DEAL_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P901253812" "If you're unhappy with the way we do buisness, I can always carve pretty smile on you."
// KINGS_DEAL_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P128125025" "I don't care how you get it done, just do it."
// KINGS_DEAL_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1523295280" "I understand if you can't come through for us again. Now tell me, where did you say your wife works again?"

// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2706040633" "You freaks think we let you take our clients away?"
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1177394481" "I'm gonna wear your skull as mask!"
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2563101189" "Come now. Bring it, you freaks!"


// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2174074927" "If he thinks I'm gonna spend ONE more night in that fleabag motel waiting for a drop then he's got another thing comin'."
// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P767088091" "I don't care what your plans are. Pick me up now or you'll be sorry."
// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2195394104" "Yeah, well, maybe he souldn't have sent his putts nephew to do the job."
// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1589904694" "...if he sent ME we wouldn't have lost that shipment."

// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3358805027" "Just shut up and come get me. Gotta go."
// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P256505233" "Oh, great! PERFECT!"
// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3410420077" "Oh, COME ON!"
// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2095833910" "How could this get any worse?"
// KINGS_FAMILY_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P517004822" "I am NOT going to die in this stinking town!"

// KINGS_FAMILY_DEAL_SKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P513976439" "Who the hell do ya think you're talkin' to? I outta put you in cement."
// KINGS_FAMILY_DEAL_SKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P219952543" "There's an order to how we do business with you punks and it ain't out here where anyone can see. The hell's a'matter with you?"

// KINGS_FAMILY_DEAL_SKULLS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P843741572" "This is just coincidence."
// KINGS_FAMILY_DEAL_SKULLS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1695363353" "Looks like a hero found out after all."
// KINGS_FAMILY_DEAL_SKULLS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3615319849" "Hang back, friend,and watch how the Skulls play dirty."
// KINGS_FAMILY_DEAL_SKULLS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3927646135" "Hold that thought, Family-man. I kill hero now."

// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P841832729" "Keep going. If any one gets tired, I hit you with bat."
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2650197907" "Yeah, that's what you get, FREAK!"
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P988792462" "It's like kicking sandbag. But it's good excercise, no?"
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1242565544" "I grow thirsty. Perhaps we hit bar after this."
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P231973621" "I try to be a nice guy, but sometimes... I dunno."

// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3906971634" "How's about we switch it up a bit. Now we fight hero."
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3185862537" "Look who comes to play. A crazy person in costume."
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P256049969" "What is that, spandex?"
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_LOST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3012786453" "Maybe we kick this one now."

// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P383443095" "What is this, Halloween? Let's give them treat."
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2857633720" "Hey, they wear skulls too. Let's kill them."
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P355728583" "Hey, look at the little freaks."
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2462307582" "Pee-yew, what is this bad smell?"

// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_VAHZILOK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2828592703" "What's with your get-up, kid. It's like Saturday morning cartoon gone bad."
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_VAHZILOK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P312173016" "Guess it's Halloween after all."
// KINGS_SKULLS_RUMBLE_VAHZILOK_ALERTED_TEXT :
