// KINGS_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P423390024" "You're not allowed here!"
// KINGS_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1109324641" "What is meaning of this?"
// KINGS_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P397182357" "I'll get you good!"
// KINGS_SOLO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4050216253" "I don't think so, freak!"

// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2356990897" "We can talk later. You understand."
// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1463318778" "You need me. Watch, I'll prove to you."
// KINGS_SKULL_DRAMA_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3477263965" "Begone, woman. I must fight now."

// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2539408778" "I grow thirsty. Maybe we all hit bar after this."
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P851256409" "I TRY to be nice guy, but sometimes... Eh, I dunno."
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1937699157" "Look at him cry like baby. Let's give him more to cry about."
// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P795076473" "Not so tough now."

// KINGS_SKULLS_KICK_PPD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3089641817" "How's about we switch it up a bit? Now we fight the hero."

// KINGS_TROLL_DEAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
